=== Ancestral origins ===

The White Balboan population is predominantly of Volisanian descent, reflecting the colonial settler population and the majority of the Redilution-era immigrants. The remainder of the community traces its origins to other Illypnian immigrant streams that arrived under the Redilution and Birthing programmes.

